  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "edb4dc8f-ffcd-4a7b-b978-de5339658786"],
 " if the complete connection ",
 StyleBox["conn", "TI"],
 " has trivial holonomy around every closed walk of the base.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"716165c3-39ac-4da5-a9c3-19bc5a09c61b"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
