}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"d4146a86-b2ed-4294-a45f-4fa8dcd2fb08"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The condition is ",
 StyleBox["hol(\[Gamma]) = id", "TI"],
 " for every closed base walk ",
 StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"],
 ", with ",
 StyleBox["hol", "TI"],
 " the holonomy of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraHolonomy"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraHolonomy", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "4e77f10e-3c3e-467b-910b-41150c44c0af"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"44a6931f-7775-4a37-aa85-39874bee6343"],

Cell["\<\
Equivalently, every connected component of the graph of connection edges, a \
horizontal leaf, meets each fiber at most once. On a connected base each leaf \
is then a global section, and the connection identifies every fiber with one \
fixed fiber.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e431c3f2-ad9b-49fd-946a-e1a4414a5808"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Over a tree every connection is flat. On a connected base with ",
 StyleBox["V", "TI"],
 " vertices and ",
 StyleBox["E", "TI"],
 " edges, with fibers of ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " points joined completely, there are ",
 StyleBox["(k!)\:1d31", "TI"],
 " connections and ",
 StyleBox["(k!)\:2c7d\:207b\.b9", "TI"],
 " of them are flat."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b1bac08b-edf5-49a7-b77b-5954fdd62bda"],

Cell["\<\
The test covers every component of the base. A graph has no faces, so the \
test is global and not a curvature measured on faces.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"eadd0eb8-2ad6-4049-9723-57ff28381060"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["conn", "TI"],
 " must be a complete connection, as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraConnectionQ"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraConnectionQ", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "feb2da5a-bde5-422e-be83-f3b616b1d640"],
 " tests; otherwise the result is ",
 Cell[BoxData["False"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e79646e-f985-4791-b7f9-c14177232909"],
 ". The empty list gives ",
 Cell[BoxData["False"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c810169-0c0c-420c-823d-77ac5d922064"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"afd7f339-e992-42ab-8863-338690df7a28"]
}, Open  ]],

